# CREDITS — Alborada

A 45-second film in the Watercolor Brush style, made entirely in code.
Finca Alborada is an invented farm: no real place, family or brand is portrayed.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music
Original score, synthesised and sampled for this film (`music/score.py`).
Plucked guitar and kalimba are physically modelled (`core/audio/pluck.py`).

Samples (CC0 1.0): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios /
Sam Gossner), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios).

## Typefaces
- Cormorant Garamond — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Catharsis Fonts)
