- IBM Plex Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (IBM)

## Picture
Every frame is drawn with the film's own brush engine (`engine.js`), on paper
generated by `paper.py`. No stock footage, no photographs, no third-party images.

## Sound effects
All foley is synthesised for this film (`mix.py`): paper, brush, pencil, wind,
birds, insects, water, mill, rake, kettle and cup.
